{
  "_readme": [
    "Add a game here and it appears in the ONLINE app on the machine.",
    "No upload to the handheld is needed.",
    "",
    "id      short name used in the URL",
    "title   shown in the game list",
    "scenes  the first scene is where a game starts",
    "        text    lines, wrapped to 16 characters by the server",
    "        options 'to' is the id of the scene to jump to",
    "        a scene with no options is an ending",
    "",
    "The screen fits three wrapped lines plus two choices, so keep each text",
    "line under about 40 characters and options under 14, and a scene shows",
    "on one screen with no extra tap. Longer text still works, the machine",
    "falls back to a scrollable page.",
    "Keep one game under about 5000 characters."
  ],
  "games": [
